      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 13  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 1 (200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Rampage (1/Day).*** Immediately after dealing damage to a creature that was already ***Bloodied***, the hyena can move up to half its ***Speed***, and it makes one Bite attack.

    type: custom
